---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
search: false
description: "Community website and free weekly newsletter for the Lenches, five villages between Evesham, Pershore and Alcester. Events, news, roads and bins."
seoTitle: "The Lenches — Church, Rous, Ab, Atch & Sheriffs Lench"
cards:
  - { title: "Events", url: "/events/", icon: calendar, text: "What's on across the villages, week by week." }
  - { title: "News", url: "/notices/", icon: notice, text: "Parish council notices and news from around the villages." }
  - { title: "Bins", url: "/bins/", icon: bins, text: "Collection days and what goes in which bin." }
---
{#- Three cards plus the newsletter sign-up card (hub-cards.njk, signupCard), then the Living here section (src/_data/livinghere.json, shared with /living-here/;
    Community folded into it 30 Oct 2026; /community/ redirects to /living-here/).
    Live lines are worked out at build time (every commit, and the pipeline commits several
    times a day): next event, notices added in the last 7 days
    (hidden if none), roads on now / coming up, next bin collection for each collection day (Monday villages and Rous Lench), recalculated in the browser
    (script at the foot) so it moves on at 10am on collection day, as the bins page does. -#}
{%- set nextEvent = (whatson.events | merge(pipeline.events) | upcoming) | first -%}
{%- set allN = pipeline | allNotices(whatson) -%}
{%- set newCount = allN | notRoadItems | newThisWeek -%}
{%- set roads = allN | roadItems | roadSplit -%}
{%- set roadParts = [] -%}
{%- if roads.now | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.now | length) + " on now"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- if roads.soon | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.soon | length) + " coming up"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- set binLines = [] -%}
{%- for b in bins | nextBins %}{% set binLines = (binLines.push(b.label + ": " + (b.date | shortDate) + ", " + (b.bins | andList)), binLines) %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set live = {
  "/events/": ("Next: " + nextEvent.title + " · " + (nextEvent.date | shortDate)) if nextEvent else "",
  "/notices/": (newCount + " new this week") if newCount else "",
  "/living-here/roads/": roadParts | join(" · ") if roadParts | length else "No works listed",
  "/bins/": binLines
} -%}
<main class="container">

  {% include "home-skyline.njk" %}
  {% include "sponsor-banner.njk" %}

  <section class="intro">
    <p class="intro-head">News, events and information for our five villages</p>
    <p class="intro-news">A free newsletter every Thursday morning: <a href="{{ '/newsletter/' | url }}">sign up here</a>.</p>
    {#- This weekend line (SEO step 4, 26 Nov 2026; lib/weekend.js). -#}
    {%- set wkCount = (whatson.events | merge(pipeline.events) | upcoming | weekendList) | length %}
    <p class="intro-news">{% if wkCount %}{{ wkCount }} {{ "event" if wkCount == 1 else "events" }} on this weekend: <a href="{{ '/events/this-weekend/' | url }}">see what's on</a>.{% else %}<a href="{{ '/events/this-weekend/' | url }}">What's on this weekend</a>{% endif %}</p>
    <p class="muted">Everything here is collected from local groups, organisations and residents, and kept as accurate and up to date as we can manage.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-cards">
    {% set signupCard = true %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}{% set signupCard = false %}
  </section>

  {#- The Lenches Community Facebook group (moved here from /contact/ 30 Oct). -#}
  <section class="home-section home-fb">
    <div class="card fb-card">
      <svg class="fb-logo" viewBox="0 0 36 36" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="18" fill="#0866FF"/><path fill="#fff" d="M20.2 36V24.4h3.9l.6-4.6h-4.5v-2.9c0-1.3.4-2.2 2.3-2.2h2.4V10.6c-.4-.1-1.8-.2-3.5-.2-3.5 0-5.8 2.1-5.8 6v3.4h-3.9v4.6h3.9V36z"/></svg>
      <div>
        <h2>The Lenches Community Facebook group</h2>
        <p>A good deal of day-to-day village chatter happens in The Lenches Community, a private Facebook group run by local volunteers: lost cats, road closures, recommendations and things for sale. You'll need to ask to join.</p>
        <p class="mb0"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/thelenchescommunity/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find the group on Facebook</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="living-here" class="home-section">
    <h2>Living here</h2>
    <p class="muted">{{ livinghere.intro }}</p>
    {% set cards = livinghere.cards %}{% set cardHeading = "h3" %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}
  </section>

  {#- Feedback form near the foot of the page (other pages: above the sign-up band). -#}
  <div class="home-feedback" data-pagefind-ignore>{% include "feedback.njk" %}</div>

  <img class="banner-img home-aerial" src="{{ '/images/lenches-aerial.jpg' | url }}" alt="The Lenches, Worcestershire, seen from the air" loading="lazy">

</main>

{% include "home-bins-script.njk" %}
